WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.020 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 21]

01:50.670 --> 01:51.460
Caught you.

01:51.800 --> 01:52.900
Are you fleeing the battle?

01:54.160 --> 01:54.690
Meng,

01:55.440 --> 01:55.940
cut it out.

01:57.760 --> 01:58.330
Han,

01:59.710 --> 02:01.490
I got these pills on my last mission

02:01.800 --> 02:03.490
to help with recovery and strengthening.

02:03.870 --> 02:04.490
Take them.

02:04.920 --> 02:05.740
Just in case.

02:07.670 --> 02:08.300
You've all heard.

02:10.110 --> 02:11.730
The Master trusts us the most.

02:13.280 --> 02:13.650
Here.

02:13.960 --> 02:14.450
Take it.

02:14.880 --> 02:15.370
Thanks.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.010
Han,

02:17.710 --> 02:18.690
why not ask Master

02:19.200 --> 02:20.180
to let me go with you?

02:20.560 --> 02:21.220
It's not easy

02:21.280 --> 02:22.650
to find a good sparring partner.

02:22.880 --> 02:24.010
I haven't had enough fun yet.

02:25.000 --> 02:26.220
The war is in full swing.

02:26.710 --> 02:27.900
You trying to dodge the fight?

02:28.640 --> 02:29.730
Who said I was dodging?

02:31.520 --> 02:31.940
Han,

02:32.390 --> 02:33.090
come here a second.

02:34.110 --> 02:34.690
I heard

02:34.880 --> 02:35.730
there's a new cosmetics shop

02:36.070 --> 02:37.690
in the capital.

02:38.390 --> 02:39.130
The Moxiang Abode.

02:40.040 --> 02:41.740
They sell all kinds of skincare and perfumes.

02:42.430 --> 02:43.490
Pick some up for me, will you?

02:44.920 --> 02:45.690
I made a list.

02:46.400 --> 02:47.180
Just follow it.

02:48.280 --> 02:49.770
Don't let Senior Liu find out.

02:55.840 --> 02:56.820
Things look lively.

02:57.350 --> 02:57.980
That brat.

02:59.310 --> 03:00.210
Let's see how he acts

03:00.230 --> 03:01.180
when he sees me on my ark.

03:23.350 --> 03:24.540
If she doesn't want to see me,

03:25.760 --> 03:27.410
then I'll just pretend

03:28.280 --> 03:29.620
we're strangers, like she said.

03:38.710 --> 03:39.930
What's that supposed to mean?

03:40.280 --> 03:41.290
He didn't even say hi.

03:43.310 --> 03:44.100
Where are you going?

03:44.710 --> 03:45.220
Aft cabin.

03:46.000 --> 03:46.730
You brat.

03:47.310 --> 03:48.410
You didn't even look at me.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.780
Who do you think you are, huh?

04:57.750 --> 04:58.500
Nangong Wan.

04:58.840 --> 05:00.660
You're already in the Core Formation Stage.

05:00.680 --> 05:02.500
Why are you still mad over some nobody?

05:03.120 --> 05:04.170
It's not worth it.

05:04.910 --> 05:05.570
I'm not mad.

05:09.080 --> 05:10.010
Calm down.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.980
Who he's with,

05:12.520 --> 05:13.610
who he's buying rouge for,

05:13.910 --> 05:15.260
has nothing to do with me!

05:16.430 --> 05:17.340
He's not even worthy.

05:52.360 --> 05:53.140
This is maddening!

05:54.270 --> 05:55.100
I'm going to forget him.

05:55.720 --> 05:56.810
I have to forget him!

05:59.070 --> 05:59.930
Back to my cultivating.

06:08.310 --> 06:09.140
Han Li...

06:10.190 --> 06:11.490
I'll never forgive you.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.540
She wouldn't

06:19.000 --> 06:20.020
really kill me, would she?

06:27.390 --> 06:28.660
That should be Yuanwu Kingdom.

06:29.560 --> 06:30.900
A good chance to find Qi Yunxiao

06:31.040 --> 06:32.220
and the array master he serves

06:32.750 --> 06:33.850
to ask about the teleport array.

06:40.310 --> 06:41.220
Mr. Han,

06:42.160 --> 06:43.340
we're not in the capital yet.

06:45.950 --> 06:46.850
I have a mission.

06:47.310 --> 06:48.050
I'll take my leave.

06:54.040 --> 06:54.540
Right.

06:55.040 --> 06:55.810
One more thing.

06:56.430 --> 06:57.850
Please pass this to Senior Nangong.

07:02.120 --> 07:02.900
What is it?

07:05.240 --> 07:05.780
Ageless Pill.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.290
Ageless Pill?

07:21.750 --> 07:22.460
Grandmaster,

07:23.830 --> 07:25.460
that guy in the back cabin left.

07:25.830 --> 07:26.540
He left?

07:27.070 --> 07:29.250
Looked like he headed toward Yuanwu Kingdom.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.370
He didn't even come to see me.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.700
He told me to give you this.

07:35.830 --> 07:36.730
Give me what?

07:37.510 --> 07:38.370
It's a pill.

07:38.600 --> 07:39.850
He said it's the Ageless Pill.

07:40.600 --> 07:41.370
Ageless Pill?

07:43.950 --> 07:44.700
What for?

07:44.920 --> 07:45.540
Does he think I'm old?

07:51.600 --> 07:52.370
You may go.

07:53.160 --> 07:53.540
Yes.

07:54.070 --> 07:54.460
Wait.

07:55.040 --> 07:56.340
Don't tell anyone about this.

07:56.800 --> 07:57.580
Especially not my senior Nichang.

08:55.560 --> 08:56.140
Forget it.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.580
I'll let you off this time.

08:57.940 --> 09:01.260
[Yunxiao Pavilion of Yuanwu Kingdom]

09:01.920 --> 09:03.250
Shouldn't you be minding the shop?

09:03.600 --> 09:04.170
Where did you go?

09:06.460 --> 09:09.060
[Out at the moment. Leave a message.]

09:09.720 --> 09:10.660
Top-grade artifact,

09:10.800 --> 09:11.540
the Flamecloud Sword.

09:11.800 --> 09:12.900
It has fire-element techniques.

09:13.190 --> 09:14.660
Personally refined

09:14.750 --> 09:15.930
by a Core Formation cultivator.

09:16.360 --> 09:16.850
Starting bid.

09:17.160 --> 09:18.050
Two hundred gems.

09:18.920 --> 09:19.540
Any takers?

09:21.040 --> 09:21.900
I'll bid three hundred.

09:22.160 --> 09:22.580
Three hundred.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.580
I bid four hundred.

09:23.720 --> 09:24.250
Four hundred.

09:24.950 --> 09:25.850
Four hundred gems!

09:26.120 --> 09:26.810
Any more bids?

09:27.120 --> 09:27.580
Five hundred.

09:27.920 --> 09:28.700
Five hundred gems!

09:28.950 --> 09:30.220
Anyone going higher?

09:30.680 --> 09:32.170
This auction's on another level...

09:32.190 --> 09:32.900
Five hundred, once.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.050
...These cultivators are all

09:34.070 --> 09:35.170
- Early Foundation Establishment. - Five hundred, twice.

09:35.920 --> 09:36.780
Five hundred, thrice.

09:37.360 --> 09:37.730
Sold!

09:39.480 --> 09:40.660
Congratulations to the bidder.

09:43.160 --> 09:43.580
Alright.

09:44.120 --> 09:44.660
Next item.

09:44.950 --> 09:45.980
Let's bring it up.

09:46.870 --> 09:47.850
High-grade pill,

09:48.390 --> 09:49.170
Ageless Pill.

09:49.830 --> 09:50.340
Two pills.

09:50.360 --> 09:50.930
Ageless Pill?

09:51.040 --> 09:51.490
Ageless Pill!

09:51.510 --> 09:52.290
I want one too!

09:52.720 --> 09:53.290
This pill

09:53.480 --> 09:55.810
- comes from the Joyful Union Sect. - I want it!

09:55.810 --> 09:57.610
- I want it too! - It's rare in the market.

09:58.190 --> 09:59.140
If you know, you know.

10:00.120 --> 10:00.660
Starting bid.

10:00.920 --> 10:01.730
One hundred gems.

10:02.480 --> 10:03.250
This stuff is good.

10:03.680 --> 10:04.250
I want this one.

10:04.390 --> 10:05.370
I bid one-thirty.

10:05.390 --> 10:06.220
You're a grown man.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.540
Why do you need the Ageless Pill?

10:08.150 --> 10:09.530
Do you have no shame?

10:09.910 --> 10:10.420
One fifty.

10:10.600 --> 10:11.250
One fifty!

10:11.790 --> 10:12.700
Two fifty.

10:12.790 --> 10:13.730
Two fifty!

10:13.790 --> 10:14.370
Three hundred.

10:14.390 --> 10:15.370
Three hundred gems!

10:15.390 --> 10:16.060
Five hundred.

10:16.080 --> 10:16.770
Five hundred gems!

10:16.910 --> 10:18.100
Any higher offers?

10:18.670 --> 10:20.100
Looks do matter in cultivation.

10:21.000 --> 10:22.490
These two Ageless Pills might sell

10:23.000 --> 10:24.490
for as much as a top-tier artifact.

10:25.320 --> 10:26.460
Five hundred, thrice.

10:27.150 --> 10:27.490
Sold!

10:28.320 --> 10:29.300
Congratulations, cultivator!

10:29.440 --> 10:30.220
Excellent.

10:31.120 --> 10:32.650
Please collect your item at the counter.

10:33.910 --> 10:34.580
Esteemed guests,

10:35.120 --> 10:35.610
next up,

10:35.870 --> 10:38.250
the twenty-eighth item of the night.

10:38.750 --> 10:40.490
It's also the final item this month.

10:41.630 --> 10:42.420
Golden Glow Ganoderma.

10:44.440 --> 10:44.940
Now that's rare.

10:44.960 --> 10:45.650
A millennium-old one.

10:47.550 --> 10:48.100
A thousand years old!

10:49.120 --> 10:50.250
No starting bid set.

10:51.910 --> 10:52.650
Smells amazing...

10:52.670 --> 10:54.460
Isn't that the one I sold

10:54.480 --> 10:55.490
to Treasure House?

10:56.510 --> 10:57.610
Is that shady merchant

10:58.510 --> 11:00.180
actually backing this auction?

11:00.480 --> 11:01.010
Eighteen hundred!

11:01.080 --> 11:01.530
Two thousand!

11:02.120 --> 11:02.580
Two thousand!

11:02.630 --> 11:03.250
Twenty-five hundred!

11:03.360 --> 11:03.770
Twenty-five hundred!

11:03.910 --> 11:04.700
Anyone higher?

11:04.910 --> 11:05.630
Twenty-five hundred!

11:05.750 --> 11:06.490
Twenty-eight hundred!

11:06.510 --> 11:07.260
Twenty-eight hundred!

11:07.610 --> 11:08.370
Thirty-three hundred!

11:08.430 --> 11:09.130
Thirty-three hundred!

11:09.630 --> 11:10.300
Thirty-eight hundred!

11:10.440 --> 11:11.180
Thirty-eight hundred!

11:12.200 --> 11:13.340
Thirty-eight hundred, once!

11:13.720 --> 11:14.250
Hold it!

11:14.630 --> 11:15.220
Qi Yunxiao?

11:16.630 --> 11:17.850
This Millennium Ganoderma

11:18.670 --> 11:19.730
shall be mine.

11:20.600 --> 11:21.580
Stop causing trouble!

11:21.910 --> 11:22.730
Guards, throw him out!

11:23.550 --> 11:24.730
- Not this again! - Who even are you?

11:25.100 --> 11:26.760
- I'll trade an array for it! - Still haven't learned, huh?

11:27.490 --> 11:28.370
-This time... - Wait!

11:28.480 --> 11:29.850
...he even dropped the disguise.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.100
Esteemed elders,

11:31.870 --> 11:34.340
I am Qi Yunxiao, an Artifact Crafter in this city.

11:35.200 --> 11:37.220
I truly need that Golden Glow Ganoderma

11:37.240 --> 11:38.100
to save a life.

11:38.910 --> 11:39.980
I'm willing to offer

11:40.080 --> 11:40.850
two high-grade arrays

11:41.240 --> 11:42.130
in exchange for it.

11:42.910 --> 11:44.010
Where did this guy come from?

11:44.360 --> 11:45.340
Two arrays, you say?

11:45.510 --> 11:46.580
I have eight myself!

11:46.910 --> 11:47.610
Throw him out!

11:47.840 --> 11:48.580
- I'm just trying to... - Kid,

11:48.720 --> 11:49.130
stand down!

11:49.440 --> 11:49.940
Get lost.

11:50.270 --> 11:50.980
Hold on, wait!

11:52.320 --> 11:52.890
Young man,

11:53.000 --> 11:53.890
come back next time.

11:56.510 --> 11:57.220
- Come on. - Elder, please!

11:57.670 --> 11:58.980
I really need it to save a life.

11:59.150 --> 11:59.610
Elder, wait!

11:59.910 --> 12:01.530
A Qi Refining rookie?

12:01.750 --> 12:02.610
An Artifact Crafter?

12:02.920 --> 12:03.370
Move it.

12:03.510 --> 12:04.450
- Four thousand! - Elder!

12:04.750 --> 12:05.890
- Four thousand! - To save a life!

12:05.950 --> 12:06.650
Four thousand!

12:06.670 --> 12:07.770
Anyone want to bid higher?

12:08.790 --> 12:09.490
Forty-five hundred!

12:09.670 --> 12:10.420
Forty-five hundred!

12:10.720 --> 12:11.340
Forty-eight hundred!

12:11.550 --> 12:12.300
Forty-eight hundred!

12:12.840 --> 12:14.580
Any higher than forty-eight hundred?

13:02.200 --> 13:02.980
Blade Arts?

13:03.240 --> 13:04.370
You're from the Fu Clan?

13:04.550 --> 13:05.610
Now that you know,

13:06.030 --> 13:07.300
even if you hand over the array,

13:07.670 --> 13:08.700
we still can't let you live.

13:22.000 --> 13:22.770
Han!

13:28.780 --> 13:34.420
[Yunxiao Pavilion]

13:38.900 --> 13:39.790
[Xin Ruyin]

13:39.790 --> 13:40.250
Yunxiao.

13:41.000 --> 13:41.530
Ruyin?

13:42.480 --> 13:43.530
How did you get hurt?

13:44.790 --> 13:46.250
I let my guard down for a moment,

13:46.550 --> 13:47.650
and some thugs mugged me.

13:47.790 --> 13:48.340
Is this girl...

13:48.360 --> 13:49.530
Han saved me.

13:49.550 --> 13:50.940
...the one he cares so much about?

13:54.750 --> 13:55.220
Han,

13:55.390 --> 13:55.850
come in.

14:01.440 --> 14:03.180
The Millennium Spirit Herb you took earlier

14:03.670 --> 14:04.890
was the one he traded to us.

14:07.870 --> 14:10.340
Yunxiao often mentioned you.

14:11.030 --> 14:12.700
You saved me once.

14:12.910 --> 14:14.700
I, Xin Ruyin, am deeply grateful.

14:19.480 --> 14:20.100
Senior Han,

14:20.360 --> 14:20.980
come inside.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.420
Han,

14:31.200 --> 14:31.980
you might not know,

14:32.670 --> 14:33.890
those two

14:34.750 --> 14:36.370
are from the Fu Clan, the top family

14:36.510 --> 14:37.130
in Yuanwu.

14:37.910 --> 14:38.490
They are trouble.

14:39.240 --> 14:39.850
My advice?

14:40.080 --> 14:41.130
Leave here soon.

14:41.870 --> 14:43.300
You stepped in to protect me.

14:43.630 --> 14:44.890
I don't want to get you involved.

14:47.840 --> 14:48.490
Just now,

14:49.200 --> 14:50.730
I wiped out all their traces.

14:51.480 --> 14:52.180
I won't stay long.

14:55.480 --> 14:56.220
However,

14:56.720 --> 14:57.490
I think you two

14:57.510 --> 14:58.940
should find somewhere quiet

14:59.360 --> 15:00.130
and lay low

15:00.670 --> 15:01.490
just to be safe.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.180
Ruyin,

15:05.670 --> 15:06.340
did you hear that?

15:07.080 --> 15:08.100
Han says

15:08.200 --> 15:10.060
we should find a quiet place and stay a while.

15:10.910 --> 15:11.580
Yunxiao,

15:12.870 --> 15:14.300
we're not even married yet.

15:19.390 --> 15:20.060
By the way, Han,

15:20.840 --> 15:22.770
thanks to Ruyin's help,

15:23.150 --> 15:24.770
the upgrade for the Five Phases Reversing Array went smoothly.

15:25.550 --> 15:27.250
Its defense is stronger now,

15:27.670 --> 15:28.490
plus it now has

15:28.720 --> 15:29.980
an illusory trap to restrain enemies.

15:30.440 --> 15:31.250
I'll go get it.

15:31.870 --> 15:32.300
Qi,

15:33.200 --> 15:33.580
no rush.

15:35.360 --> 15:36.490
Since Miss Ruyin is here too,

15:37.840 --> 15:38.420
I actually came

15:39.030 --> 15:39.820
to ask for your help

15:40.200 --> 15:41.340
to appraise something.

15:45.000 --> 15:45.770
Teleportation,

15:46.200 --> 15:46.770
stabilization,

15:47.240 --> 15:47.980
acceleration,

15:48.630 --> 15:49.580
spiritual channeling,

15:49.840 --> 15:50.530
amplification.

15:52.630 --> 15:53.420
I can't believe

15:53.440 --> 15:54.890
this ancient teleport array

15:54.910 --> 15:55.700
actually exists.

15:56.240 --> 15:56.890
Once this array

15:57.390 --> 15:58.460
is infused with spiritual power,

15:59.030 --> 15:59.980
it can teleport

16:00.200 --> 16:01.010
across great distances.

16:04.120 --> 16:04.650
It seems

16:04.670 --> 16:06.300
you also need a Greater Teleport Command Seal

16:06.480 --> 16:08.010
to withstand spatial turbulence.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.530
Judging by your expression,

16:12.870 --> 16:15.060
that shouldn't be a problem for you.

16:17.440 --> 16:18.340
Unfortunately,

16:18.750 --> 16:20.010
this array isn't complete.

16:20.510 --> 16:21.180
A part is missing.

16:22.360 --> 16:23.420
It may no longer be usable.

16:25.240 --> 16:26.370
Do you think you can

16:27.030 --> 16:27.610
restore it?

16:28.720 --> 16:29.250
This array

16:29.390 --> 16:30.370
is very ancient,

16:30.670 --> 16:31.650
and part of it is broken.

16:32.320 --> 16:33.130
To fix it

16:33.270 --> 16:34.940
would take rare high-grade materials.

16:35.750 --> 16:37.010
It also involves a secret art.

16:39.150 --> 16:39.770
Right now,

16:40.670 --> 16:41.850
I'm still unwell.

16:42.510 --> 16:43.820
I'm afraid we're not able

16:44.840 --> 16:45.700
to help you with it.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.100
We're truly sorry.

16:50.480 --> 16:51.580
If it's about the cost,

16:52.000 --> 16:52.530
don't worry.

16:53.000 --> 16:53.980
I'll handle all of it.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.820
I still have

16:57.030 --> 16:57.580
Golden Glow Ganoderma.

16:58.120 --> 16:58.890
I can trade it.

17:09.080 --> 17:09.610
Ruyin,

17:10.120 --> 17:11.060
your illness can be cured.

17:11.240 --> 17:12.130
Let's just agree to it.

17:12.320 --> 17:13.100
Don't worry, Han.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.250
I'll figure it out.

17:14.630 --> 17:15.130
Yunxiao,

17:16.120 --> 17:16.940
my condition

17:17.320 --> 17:19.180
comes from being born with the Dragon Roar Body.

17:20.360 --> 17:21.060
As I cultivate,

17:21.270 --> 17:22.850
my meridians

17:22.960 --> 17:23.940
gradually wither.

17:24.440 --> 17:25.460
No medicine can cure it.

17:26.480 --> 17:27.530
To have lived this long

17:27.790 --> 17:28.650
is already a blessing.

17:29.790 --> 17:30.730
I shouldn't

17:31.390 --> 17:32.220
leave you disappointed

17:32.790 --> 17:33.940
and waste

17:34.550 --> 17:35.890
Senior Han's spirit herb.

17:37.440 --> 17:38.300
Besides,

17:38.720 --> 17:40.220
the demonic sects are on the rise.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.490
The ancient teleport array

17:42.790 --> 17:44.010
is bound to attract attention.

17:45.030 --> 17:45.650
She must think

17:46.240 --> 17:48.060
I'll betray them when they are no longer useful,

17:48.320 --> 17:49.490
then silence them for good.

17:50.670 --> 17:51.220
Looks like

17:51.790 --> 17:53.300
I'll have to put her doubts to rest.

17:57.630 --> 17:58.100
Hear me out.

17:59.080 --> 18:00.010
I'm a free soul

18:00.550 --> 18:01.530
with no interest in power.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.300
But with the world in chaos now,

18:04.600 --> 18:05.700
a great conflict is brewing.

18:06.440 --> 18:07.890
We can't just idle away anymore.

18:09.480 --> 18:09.940
This time,

18:10.600 --> 18:11.580
it was pure chance

18:12.480 --> 18:14.250
that I came upon this ancient teleport array.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.010
Naturally,

18:16.360 --> 18:17.890
I planned to use it as an escape route.

18:19.840 --> 18:20.850
Though I'm no expert,

18:21.720 --> 18:23.100
I've studied a bit of medicine.

18:24.390 --> 18:25.580
The ancients once said

18:26.000 --> 18:27.610
this world is vast and full of wonders.

18:28.320 --> 18:29.940
No disease is incurable.

18:31.720 --> 18:32.730
We only think so because

18:33.270 --> 18:34.220
of our limited knowledge.

18:35.240 --> 18:35.890
Miss Ruyin,

18:36.270 --> 18:37.850
don't ever give up hope.

18:38.670 --> 18:39.650
Han is right.

18:40.240 --> 18:41.180
With this array,

18:41.590 --> 18:42.420
nowhere is

18:42.720 --> 18:43.660
out of our reach.

18:45.720 --> 18:46.220
Ruyin,

18:47.070 --> 18:47.770
stop saying

18:47.790 --> 18:49.570
it's pointless to find a cure.

18:51.030 --> 18:52.860
With Han and this array,

18:53.590 --> 18:55.250
we'll definitely find a way to heal you.

19:03.030 --> 19:03.860
Senior Han,

19:04.440 --> 19:05.900
if that day really comes,

19:07.550 --> 19:09.140
would you take us with you?

19:18.960 --> 19:19.380
Of course.

19:28.640 --> 19:29.460
Come to think of it,

19:30.070 --> 19:31.570
this is my first time in the capital.

19:33.070 --> 19:34.530
The cultivation world is in chaos,

19:35.200 --> 19:36.560
yet this place stays lively

19:36.750 --> 19:37.460
as if untouched.

19:38.880 --> 19:39.700
I just wonder

19:39.960 --> 19:40.770
how long this peace

19:41.400 --> 19:42.660
will truly last.

19:42.680 --> 19:43.180
Grandpa!

19:43.200 --> 19:44.730
Grandpa, come chase me!

19:44.960 --> 19:46.010
- Cui'er! - Sweet sugar hawthorn!

19:46.110 --> 19:47.250
- I'm over here! - Fresh sugar hawthorn!

19:47.270 --> 19:48.380
Sweet sugar hawthorn!

19:48.560 --> 19:50.140
Watch where you're going, little girl!

19:51.960 --> 19:52.570
Cui'er!

19:53.070 --> 19:54.180
Don't run, Cui'er. Slow down!

19:54.200 --> 19:55.330
Careful! Slow down!

19:55.350 --> 19:55.900
Cui'er!

20:00.940 --> 20:02.940
[Xiao Zhen, Qi Refining Stage]

20:03.270 --> 20:04.460
Qi Refining Stage?

20:05.750 --> 20:06.730
I can't detect his cultivation.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.530
Did he use Aura Concealment?

20:10.940 --> 20:12.020
[Mind Control Spell]

20:27.440 --> 20:27.900
I was a fool

20:28.030 --> 20:29.050
for not knowing your might.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.050
I offended you, Master.

20:30.160 --> 20:31.420
Please forgive me!

20:35.790 --> 20:36.420
Calm down.

20:37.200 --> 20:37.900
Your technique

20:38.350 --> 20:39.180
is rather interesting.

20:39.750 --> 20:41.090
I've memorized your aura.

20:41.440 --> 20:42.380
Once I'm done here,

20:42.790 --> 20:43.730
I'll come find you again.

20:45.880 --> 20:47.090
Come take a look!

20:47.720 --> 20:48.530
Painted umbrellas!

20:48.960 --> 20:49.530
Sir,

20:50.000 --> 20:51.330
where is the Qin Residence?

20:56.070 --> 20:56.460
Thank you.

20:57.750 --> 20:59.420
Fresh and fragrant buns here!

21:01.960 --> 21:02.810
Grandpa, what's wrong?

21:02.810 --> 21:03.370
[Xiao Cui'er]

21:03.370 --> 21:04.360
- Did someone bully you? - Run!

21:04.360 --> 21:05.030
Run!

21:05.720 --> 21:06.570
Wait, what's going on?

21:06.590 --> 21:07.180
Hurry, let's go!

21:17.830 --> 21:18.420
Who are you?

21:18.750 --> 21:19.730
[Qin Gui]
You trespassed into the Qin Residence.

21:19.920 --> 21:20.530
That's a crime!

21:21.350 --> 21:22.010
Sir, please...

21:22.070 --> 21:22.980
Who are you calling "sir"?

21:24.070 --> 21:24.700
Handsome,

21:25.440 --> 21:26.290
it's an urgent matter.

21:26.400 --> 21:27.290
I must see your master.

21:27.830 --> 21:28.770
Please inform him.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.010
My master isn't

21:30.030 --> 21:31.460
someone you can meet on a whim.

21:36.300 --> 21:39.220
[To Qin Yan]

21:41.030 --> 21:42.530
That's our lord's name...

21:45.550 --> 21:46.090
Come with me.

22:03.880 --> 22:05.250
Qin Yan greets the Master.

22:05.790 --> 22:06.860
I failed to recognize you

22:06.880 --> 22:07.770
and showed disrespect.

22:07.960 --> 22:09.180
Please forgive my offense.

22:11.030 --> 22:11.570
Master,

22:11.880 --> 22:12.220
take a seat.

22:12.350 --> 22:12.980
Please sit.

22:13.310 --> 22:13.660
Have a seat.

22:14.310 --> 22:14.700
Please.

22:17.590 --> 22:18.530
Calm yourself down.

22:19.200 --> 22:20.310
As the letter stated,

22:20.750 --> 22:21.220
I, Han,

22:21.480 --> 22:22.530
came on my master's orders.

22:23.240 --> 22:24.220
I may have to

22:24.400 --> 22:25.290
stay for a few days.

22:25.620 --> 22:27.510
[Qin Yan]

22:27.510 --> 22:28.900
Thank you for your generosity.

22:29.310 --> 22:30.700
You bring honor to our humble home.

22:31.750 --> 22:33.220
Before my father passed away,

22:33.790 --> 22:35.940
he once said that if disaster ever befell the Qin family,

22:36.400 --> 22:38.180
Master Li would surely lend us a hand.

22:39.270 --> 22:39.980
May I know

22:40.000 --> 22:42.010
if that's the reason you've come, Master Han?

22:43.000 --> 22:44.180
You need not ask further.

22:44.880 --> 22:45.490
But indeed,

22:45.790 --> 22:46.900
my master sent me here

22:47.640 --> 22:49.090
to ensure your family survives

22:49.960 --> 22:50.660
this coming disaster.

22:52.310 --> 22:53.180
A disaster...

22:53.830 --> 22:54.490
In that case,

22:54.880 --> 22:56.220
the lives of the entire Qin family

22:56.400 --> 22:57.940
are in your care, Master Han!

23:00.400 --> 23:01.620
No wonder he's a man of power.

23:02.200 --> 23:03.620
Much more sensible than the gatekeeper.

23:04.350 --> 23:05.250
We are in your hands.

23:06.560 --> 23:07.510
Please protect us.

23:09.200 --> 23:09.900
At ease, Lord Qin.

23:16.510 --> 23:17.330
This is my sect's duty,

23:17.960 --> 23:18.460
so I will

23:18.790 --> 23:19.700
do my best.

23:23.960 --> 23:24.730
However, for this mission,

23:25.070 --> 23:26.530
I was ordered to proceed

23:26.830 --> 23:27.490
in secret.

23:28.310 --> 23:29.420
From now on, we shall

23:29.790 --> 23:31.380
address each other as uncle and nephew.

23:31.960 --> 23:32.860
Uncle and nephew...

23:34.960 --> 23:36.090
As you wish, Master.

23:36.550 --> 23:37.490
As you wish, Master.

23:37.790 --> 23:39.140
As you wish, Master.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.140
As you wish, Master.

23:40.350 --> 23:41.730
- As you wish, Master. - That's enough.

23:44.510 --> 23:45.140
Please, have a seat.

23:47.440 --> 23:48.180
From now on,

23:48.960 --> 23:50.050
we're uncle and nephew.

23:55.840 --> 23:57.810
Did he say he's the descendant of the old Master's friend?

23:58.040 --> 23:58.500
Yes.

24:00.480 --> 24:01.940
Sounds like another freeloader to me.

24:02.640 --> 24:03.530
Young Master, Madam,

24:03.710 --> 24:05.090
while I was observing in the hall,

24:05.110 --> 24:06.740
The Master was rather indifferent at first,

24:06.760 --> 24:08.010
but after reading the letter,

24:08.160 --> 24:09.060
his expression turned grave.

24:09.110 --> 24:10.820
He even dismissed all the servants

24:10.950 --> 24:12.300
to speak with him alone.

24:14.240 --> 24:15.290
How old is he?

24:16.110 --> 24:17.210
[Madam Qin]
And what does he look like?

24:17.270 --> 24:18.220
Tell me everything.

24:18.790 --> 24:19.330
Madam,

24:20.160 --> 24:21.900
his looks are very ordinary.

24:22.200 --> 24:23.660
His clothes were plain and shabby.

24:24.160 --> 24:25.220
At first, I thought he

24:25.240 --> 24:27.140
was another penniless fool trying to make a connection.

24:28.160 --> 24:29.490
But I've served Master since childhood.

24:29.790 --> 24:31.050
He's never treated anyone

24:31.070 --> 24:32.090
[Qin Fei]
with such respect.

24:40.830 --> 24:41.530
Come!

24:42.200 --> 24:44.090
The Master actually poured tea for him.

24:44.270 --> 24:44.980
I want him dead.

24:45.440 --> 24:45.860
Qin Gui!

24:46.440 --> 24:47.380
Throw him out!

24:48.550 --> 24:49.090
Madam,

24:49.310 --> 24:50.140
I wouldn't dare!

24:50.400 --> 24:50.940
Calm down.

24:51.240 --> 24:51.860
Please calm down.

25:12.720 --> 25:13.220
Grandpa!

25:13.270 --> 25:14.620
Cui'er, hide quickly!

26:44.400 --> 26:45.520
Who did this?

26:45.520 --> 26:47.090
It's a complete mess in here!

26:47.090 --> 26:48.370
So much blood...

26:48.830 --> 26:49.660
The mark

26:49.920 --> 26:51.490
on the old man from yesterday

26:51.880 --> 26:52.460
vanished here.

26:53.590 --> 26:54.770
The trail is still fresh.

26:55.350 --> 26:56.380
It must have just happened.

27:11.070 --> 27:12.420
Rogue cultivators,

27:12.960 --> 27:15.180
welcome to your paradise,

27:15.350 --> 27:16.860
the Black Fiend Cult.

27:18.920 --> 27:19.940
Everyone here

27:20.270 --> 27:21.700
has been cast aside by the Seven Sects.

27:22.030 --> 27:23.140
- Da. - We're...

27:23.160 --> 27:23.700
Quiet!

27:23.880 --> 27:25.380
- ...not overthrowing the Seven Sects. - Let him finish.

27:26.070 --> 27:28.180
And we won't make you die for us either.

27:28.680 --> 27:30.700
We just want you to know

27:31.720 --> 27:32.860
the so-called Foundation Pill

27:33.640 --> 27:34.860
is a lie by the Seven Sects!

27:35.440 --> 27:36.380
Without that pill,

27:37.030 --> 27:38.810
you can still break through Qi Refining

27:39.240 --> 27:40.220
and reach the next stage!

27:40.510 --> 27:41.490
Seriously?

27:41.510 --> 27:43.220
The Master of the Black Fiend Cult

27:44.070 --> 27:45.470
is using a secret technique.

27:46.110 --> 27:46.670
Soon,

27:47.590 --> 27:49.530
he'll break through to Core Formation.

27:50.160 --> 27:52.050
What the Seven Sects keep hidden,

27:52.880 --> 27:54.330
our Black Fiend Cult

27:54.750 --> 27:55.940
shares with all of you.

27:56.790 --> 27:57.730
Now,

27:58.400 --> 27:59.700
the Black Fiend Cult

28:00.240 --> 28:01.730
is willing to share

28:02.200 --> 28:03.570
our secret arts with you all

28:04.240 --> 28:05.730
so we may cultivate together.

28:06.110 --> 28:06.620
Da,

28:07.110 --> 28:08.420
this sounds sketchy to me.

28:08.750 --> 28:09.330
What should we do then?

28:10.160 --> 28:11.700
Sharing secret arts!

28:11.830 --> 28:13.330
- Cultivating together! - What is this place?

28:13.400 --> 28:15.460
- Who are these people? - Sharing secret arts!

28:16.030 --> 28:17.660
[Meng Wu]
Cultivate together!

28:17.920 --> 28:19.460
Share secret arts!

28:19.830 --> 28:21.530
Cultivate together!

28:21.750 --> 28:23.250
Share secret arts!

28:23.590 --> 28:25.490
Cultivate together!

28:40.270 --> 28:40.940
San.

28:41.590 --> 28:42.330
You alright?

28:42.720 --> 28:43.220
I'm fine.

28:48.400 --> 28:49.050
How do you feel?

28:49.790 --> 28:50.770
I'm all itchy.

28:58.270 --> 28:58.900
It has nothing

28:58.960 --> 28:59.620
to do with me.

29:00.510 --> 29:01.050
Sir,

29:01.160 --> 29:01.900
save my grandpa!

29:02.110 --> 29:02.700
Let go!

29:06.720 --> 29:07.770
If you save my grandpa,

29:08.000 --> 29:08.730
I'll give you

29:08.750 --> 29:10.390
this book that holds the Aura Concealment.

29:10.640 --> 29:11.090
No.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.660
I'll even serve you if you want!

29:16.310 --> 29:17.140
I already told you,

29:17.240 --> 29:18.090
I can't help you.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.090
Stop bothering me.

29:19.270 --> 29:19.770
Leave now.

29:22.240 --> 29:23.180
If you won't help me,

29:23.270 --> 29:24.290
then I'll just die right here!

29:31.750 --> 29:32.570
If you won't help me,

29:32.960 --> 29:34.140
then kill me yourself!

29:34.310 --> 29:35.090
We rogue cultivators

29:35.110 --> 29:36.090
are all being hunted anyway.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.010
They got my grandpa yesterday.

29:37.200 --> 29:38.220
Last month, a boy from the Li family.

29:38.240 --> 29:39.380
Three months ago, it was Miss Zhao.

29:39.830 --> 29:40.980
Next time, it might be me.

29:42.480 --> 29:43.330
How is it my concern?

29:44.720 --> 29:45.980
Grandpa was right after all.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.810
You are all two-faced hypocrites.

29:47.830 --> 29:49.700
You don't care if rogue cultivators live or die!

29:49.830 --> 29:51.180
If it weren't for that Aura Concealment,

29:51.480 --> 29:52.980
Grandpa wouldn't have left the city.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.010
And if I hadn't

29:54.270 --> 29:55.700
insisted on seeing the Lantern Festival...

29:55.960 --> 29:56.730
If it weren't...

30:05.270 --> 30:05.700
What is it?

30:09.240 --> 30:09.660
Young Master,

30:09.880 --> 30:12.010
The Master has asked you to come to the front hall.

30:12.310 --> 30:13.810
He says it's something important.

30:14.790 --> 30:15.090
Alright.

30:15.310 --> 30:15.700
Understood.

30:16.440 --> 30:16.770
Hold on a sec.

30:21.070 --> 30:21.980
Sorry about this.

30:26.350 --> 30:26.810
As for you,

30:27.350 --> 30:28.420
we'll settle this later.

30:35.880 --> 30:37.010
They were all taken,

30:37.400 --> 30:38.570
but not killed on the spot.

30:39.160 --> 30:40.380
Seems like they're still useful.

30:41.640 --> 30:43.330
It's no easy task to control so many rogues.

30:44.200 --> 30:45.620
They must be locked up separately.

30:46.240 --> 30:46.810
There are

30:47.030 --> 30:48.050
different locations too.

30:49.880 --> 30:51.050
Did Uncle Qin say what it was about?

30:51.070 --> 30:51.940
Young Master,

30:52.400 --> 30:53.770
Prince Xin's estate sent an invitation.

30:54.160 --> 30:55.330
The Master thinks highly of you.

30:55.830 --> 30:56.660
Perhaps he wants

30:56.750 --> 30:57.660
to take you along.

30:58.240 --> 30:59.220
You'll know when you're there.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.010
Greetings, Mr. Qin.

31:11.920 --> 31:13.420
Steward Wang, how have you been?

31:13.510 --> 31:14.320
[Steward Wang]
Thanks to you, quite well.

31:15.110 --> 31:15.420
Please.

31:15.550 --> 31:15.900
Yes.

31:19.310 --> 31:20.090
Qin Fei,

31:20.440 --> 31:21.010
you sit here.

31:23.350 --> 31:23.730
Han Li,

31:24.030 --> 31:24.530
you sit here.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.050
Please, Young Master Han.

31:38.200 --> 31:39.860
What a strange wave of spiritual power.

31:40.960 --> 31:41.730
The demonic sects?

31:48.000 --> 31:48.660
Young Master Qin,

31:49.160 --> 31:49.530
please.

32:09.200 --> 32:10.490
Prince Xin has arrived.

32:17.140 --> 32:19.940
[Prince Xin]

32:22.510 --> 32:23.810
Tonight's family banquet

32:24.200 --> 32:24.860
is an opportunity

32:25.070 --> 32:26.220
for me to share

32:26.240 --> 32:27.530
a once-in-a-lifetime chance

32:27.920 --> 32:29.730
with all of you.

32:31.110 --> 32:31.770
Steward Wang,

32:32.310 --> 32:33.090
invite the cultivator.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.940
Amazing!

32:44.920 --> 32:45.900
Incredible!

32:58.340 --> 33:00.820
[Wu Sanxing]

33:09.000 --> 33:10.930
It may just be a basic Fireball Technique,

33:11.510 --> 33:13.570
but the control was remarkably precise.

33:14.110 --> 33:15.090
Quite interesting.

33:20.750 --> 33:21.380
Good.

33:21.550 --> 33:22.010
Excellent.

33:22.110 --> 33:22.770
So impressive.

33:22.990 --> 33:24.180
- Amazing. - Truly spectacular.

33:28.680 --> 33:29.420
Honored guests,

33:31.400 --> 33:32.050
this cultivator

33:32.200 --> 33:33.570
shares a connection with the Prince.

33:34.350 --> 33:34.810
He has

33:34.960 --> 33:35.860
accepted the Young Prince

33:36.070 --> 33:37.050
as his personal disciple.

33:37.310 --> 33:38.330
All this fuss,

33:39.110 --> 33:40.420
and he's just a Tier 5 Qi Refiner?

33:41.510 --> 33:42.220
He's also seeking

33:42.400 --> 33:43.980
others with spirit roots and potential

33:44.510 --> 33:45.860
to guide them onto the immortal path

33:46.550 --> 33:48.660
and teach the way to eternal life.

34:00.920 --> 34:02.530
He is indeed a cultivator,

34:03.160 --> 34:04.530
but his cultivation is weak.

34:04.880 --> 34:06.380
He won't stir up much trouble.

34:08.440 --> 34:08.980
Master.

34:10.240 --> 34:10.660
Master.

34:21.350 --> 34:21.810
Master.

34:21.960 --> 34:22.420
Master.

34:22.720 --> 34:23.710
Can you take a look at me?

34:24.030 --> 34:25.550
Look at me, please.

34:25.550 --> 34:27.110
Please, look at me!

34:28.510 --> 34:30.290
Aside from this Steward Wang,

34:30.680 --> 34:31.660
no one else here

34:32.240 --> 34:33.220
has any spiritual power.

35:05.400 --> 35:05.980
Miss Mo?

35:07.200 --> 35:07.940
Why is she here?

35:23.030 --> 35:24.660
You caused the commotion last night.

35:26.310 --> 35:27.250
How did it end up like this?

35:28.000 --> 35:30.140
[Young Prince]
We got the old one. The girl escaped.

35:30.790 --> 35:32.570
No idea what spell she used,

35:32.880 --> 35:33.980
but she hid her aura well.

35:35.480 --> 35:36.810
Master will soon return.

35:37.270 --> 35:38.250
No mistakes are allowed.

35:38.960 --> 35:40.010
You're being too flashy.

35:41.160 --> 35:42.140
If this causes trouble,

35:42.640 --> 35:43.810
and Master gets upset,

35:44.150 --> 35:44.650
he might use us

35:45.070 --> 35:45.530
as dummies!

35:47.710 --> 35:48.170
Understood.

35:48.400 --> 35:49.050
Protector.

35:51.230 --> 35:51.900
Lately,

35:52.150 --> 35:53.610
I've told those five idiots

35:54.110 --> 35:54.860
to search the capital

35:55.070 --> 35:56.050
for rogue cultivators.

36:13.280 --> 36:13.980
Miss Mo?

36:14.710 --> 36:15.570
Why are you here?

36:16.320 --> 36:17.340
You're here too?

36:21.590 --> 36:23.260
You're tailing Steward Wang?

36:25.510 --> 36:27.050
He's the one I told you about.

36:27.280 --> 36:28.460
He wiped out my clan,

36:28.480 --> 36:29.690
Sect Leader of the Five-Color Sect.

36:30.230 --> 36:31.340
He's dangerous.

36:31.630 --> 36:32.820
Way out of your league.

36:36.840 --> 36:37.980
Is he a cultivator?

36:39.070 --> 36:39.690
More or less.

36:41.230 --> 36:42.260
But he reeks of dark aura.

36:42.710 --> 36:43.690
Clearly a demonic type.

36:43.960 --> 36:44.610
Not a righteous man.

36:46.710 --> 36:48.170
I should've figured.

36:49.150 --> 36:50.530
Everything he said,

36:51.480 --> 36:53.010
and all those shady dealings...

36:55.590 --> 36:57.980
How are there so many cultivators in the world,

36:58.840 --> 37:00.300
and I just happen to meet them all?

37:05.800 --> 37:06.650
Miss Mo,

37:07.360 --> 37:08.340
this place is dangerous.

37:08.480 --> 37:09.170
Before anyone sees you,

37:09.230 --> 37:09.820
go back.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.900
Don't come again.

37:20.030 --> 37:21.090
Li.

37:23.480 --> 37:24.460
I thought

37:27.030 --> 37:28.490
I'd never see you again.

37:30.230 --> 37:31.260
On the day we parted

37:31.710 --> 37:33.010
at the Yan Clan Stronghold,

37:33.920 --> 37:35.460
you didn't say anything.

37:37.070 --> 37:38.130
But I knew

37:39.670 --> 37:41.860
a mortal like me who can't cultivate

37:44.400 --> 37:46.570
could never walk the same path as you.

37:48.400 --> 37:50.090
Our lives are far too short,

37:51.550 --> 37:52.490
like morning dew

37:53.320 --> 37:54.690
that will be gone in a blink.

37:56.190 --> 37:57.650
All love, hate, longing

37:57.840 --> 37:59.130
will turn to dust.

38:01.710 --> 38:04.010
But even with such a fleeting life,

38:04.030 --> 38:05.570
I still want to make it count.

38:07.000 --> 38:08.690
Even if it's like a moth to a flame,

38:09.280 --> 38:10.050
even if

38:10.510 --> 38:11.610
it ends in nothing,

38:12.550 --> 38:13.650
I still want to try.

38:13.960 --> 38:14.490
But you...

38:14.590 --> 38:15.570
Li!

38:19.280 --> 38:20.260
All these years,

38:21.590 --> 38:22.530
you haven't changed

38:24.670 --> 38:26.010
a single bit.

38:41.920 --> 38:42.900
Don't worry.

38:44.670 --> 38:45.570
Today,

38:46.360 --> 38:47.490
I won't kill him.

38:48.710 --> 38:50.740
I won't go head-on with him again.

38:53.150 --> 38:55.340
I'll do as you and Father taught me.

38:56.510 --> 38:57.340
I'll do it

38:57.960 --> 38:58.940
one step at a time,

38:59.960 --> 39:01.780
find his weakness and trap him,

39:02.000 --> 39:03.650
until the day I can kill him.

39:06.070 --> 39:07.490
No matter how it's done,

39:08.800 --> 39:10.420
no matter how long it takes.

40:08.110 --> 40:09.050
Farewell,

40:11.510 --> 40:12.420
Li.

40:36.840 --> 40:37.650
Miss Mo.

40:53.880 --> 40:55.170
If I told you to stop,

40:56.030 --> 40:56.820
you wouldn't listen.

41:05.360 --> 41:06.010
Very well, then.

41:34.670 --> 41:36.130
You've been compromised.

41:38.150 --> 41:39.340
Do you admit your guilt?

41:46.190 --> 41:48.490
I was too blind to see your powerful presence.

41:49.070 --> 41:51.980
Please, spare me!

41:58.550 --> 41:59.380
Senior,

42:01.360 --> 42:02.130
I am just

42:02.400 --> 42:03.530
a newcomer here.

42:04.190 --> 42:05.610
All I've done is enjoy

42:05.630 --> 42:06.740
some mortal offerings.

42:07.030 --> 42:08.300
I don't know

42:09.630 --> 42:11.530
what crime I've committed.

42:12.070 --> 42:13.210
Whether you have or not,

42:13.760 --> 42:15.260
that's for me to decide.

42:16.590 --> 42:17.900
I'll ask the questions.

42:18.630 --> 42:19.940
Answer truthfully.

42:20.190 --> 42:20.860
Yes!

42:21.030 --> 42:21.530
Yes!

42:21.800 --> 42:22.740
You may rise.

42:23.110 --> 42:23.980
Thank you, Senior.

42:24.070 --> 42:25.050
Many thanks, Senior.

42:28.710 --> 42:30.000
What is your name?

42:30.030 --> 42:31.300
Who is your master?

42:32.110 --> 42:33.490
That Fire Control Technique you used

42:33.670 --> 42:35.050
back in the hall,

42:35.510 --> 42:37.170
where did you learn it?

42:38.400 --> 42:39.460
Senior,

42:40.510 --> 42:41.530
I'm Wu Sanxing.

42:41.550 --> 42:42.460
I have no sect or master.

42:43.000 --> 42:44.340
I'm just a rogue cultivator.

42:45.150 --> 42:46.300
As for that spell,

42:47.150 --> 42:48.090
I developed it

42:48.320 --> 42:49.420
through my own practice

42:50.360 --> 42:51.490
and knowledge.

42:52.000 --> 42:53.340
It was a simple trick

42:53.550 --> 42:54.820
to fool the mortals.

42:55.880 --> 42:57.050
I meant no offense.

42:59.840 --> 43:02.300
If you like it,

43:02.630 --> 43:03.860
I'm willing

43:04.230 --> 43:05.900
to offer it up with both hands.

43:06.760 --> 43:08.090
A smooth talker.

43:08.960 --> 43:10.900
Clearly used to dealing in the mortal world

43:11.110 --> 43:12.420
and very street smart.

43:12.960 --> 43:14.210
Quite impressive.

43:34.540 --> 43:39.860
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:41.100 --> 43:46.500
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:46.620 --> 43:49.820
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:50.060 --> 43:52.300
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:52.700 --> 43:55.540
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:56.060 --> 44:00.020
♪Easier just to miss♪

44:00.860 --> 44:06.340
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

44:07.500 --> 44:12.780
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

44:13.380 --> 44:16.420
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

44:16.700 --> 44:18.820
♪Swept away by time♪

44:19.460 --> 44:22.100
♪Eyes once looked far♪

44:22.580 --> 44:26.540
♪Now lost in the shift♪

44:27.020 --> 44:29.860
♪Autumn winds stir♪

44:30.140 --> 44:32.060
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:32.500 --> 44:34.940
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:35.260 --> 44:38.780
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:39.340 --> 44:42.300
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:42.620 --> 44:45.540
♪Time lost its name♪

44:45.940 --> 44:48.780
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:49.180 --> 44:52.740
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:53.100 --> 44:55.940
♪The world has changed♪

44:56.340 --> 44:58.180
♪Beyond recall♪

44:58.740 --> 45:00.460
♪Time will fade♪

45:00.860 --> 45:05.660
♪All the words ever spoken♪

45:06.340 --> 45:09.220
♪Only this longing remains♪

45:09.700 --> 45:14.980
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

45:16.100 --> 45:22.740
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

45:23.220 --> 45:32.940
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
